        <p>Stateless singletons + a request-scoped context means safe concurrency without locks.</p>
        <p>One place per concern: the pipeline owns ordering, rules own validation, the client owns the bank format.</p>
        <p>Adding a step or a rule never touches the controller or the service.</p>
      </content>
